# SYNTHETIC fixture (Phase 2 T5). HTTP 503 + Retry-After snapshot → ErrorClass.RATE_LIMITED.
# Custom .http format (fixtures README): lines starting with '#' are comments; 'HTTP-STATUS: <int>'
# gives the status; remaining 'Key: Value' lines are response headers; the first blank line
# separates headers from the raw body. Response headers are persisted alongside the body so the
# Retry-After signal round-trips (arxiv.md §6 ⑥). Verify header/body fidelity in T7 online smoke.
HTTP-STATUS: 503
Retry-After: 120
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8

Retry after 120 seconds.
